      "Text": "Security update for openvpn",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for openvpn fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-13122: denial of service via a malformed authentication token that triggers a reachable assertion when\n  external-auth is enabled (bsc#1270413).\n- CVE-2026-13698: denial of service via memory leak triggered by remote attackers with a valid tls-crypt-v2 client key\n  (bsc#1270414).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
